          %h3#hopf_bimodules Hopf bimodules
          %p
            One can also consider Hopf bimodules, and similar categories. A Hopf
            = succeed "-bimodule" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi H
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H
